Revision history for Math-Basic-XS

0.06    2026-10-23
        - Require ExtUtils::MakeMaker 7.12, older ones build no XS
        - Fix callbacks losing their result on perls before 5.12, and $_ not being restored
        - Fix sum, min and max truncating to integers, and use the full NV on quadmath perls
        - Fix median picking the wrong element for 3, 6, 7 and other counts
        - Return undef from min, max, mean, median and mode for an empty list
        - Export with Ex::Op instead of Import::Export, perl 5.10 or later

0.01    Date/time
        First version, released on an unsuspecting world.

